    "description": "Harvard Medical School brings together the brightest minds in science and medicine to improve health and well-being for all.  \n\nWith our affiliated  hospitals and research institutes, we are home to more than 12,000 faculty members and 1,600 medical and graduate students — more than twice that of any other medical school in the United States. The possibilities for mentorship and impact across a range of disciplines at HMS are unparalleled.\n\nHarvard Medical School has:\n\n► Trained generations of doctors and researchers, pioneering new educational models and curricula to continually address emerging needs in health care \n\n► Made impactful discoveries and fueled innovation, including life-changing new therapies for cancer, diabetes, and sickle cell disease and new knowledge addressing rising health care costs and health inequities \n\n► Collaborated with local community organizations to improve health for vulnerable populations \n\nOur community is united in its desire to tackle complex challenges in science, medicine, and health, guided by a shared sense of purpose and a genuine passion to make a difference.",
